From 3aae901711c0b06837e0c0e71dff3ab0594582c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 18:23:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 22/52] Replace the tools panel with an Agents panel in
 embedded builds

Lists the machine's recent Claude Code, Codex and Gemini CLI conversations
from the host. Hovering a row streams a short summary from the host;
clicking opens the conversation in the host or resumes it in a new tab.
The toolbar button and header item become "Agents" with a stars icon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
